✨ Montessori Math Adventure ✨

A fun, colourful, and interactive math game designed to help children build confidence in early numeracy skills through play.

Features include:
🍎 Counting Objects
🔢 Number Matching
➕ Addition
➖ Subtraction
📿 Place Value with Beads
✏️ Number Tracing
🏆 Rewards and Achievement System

The game is designed to make learning mathematics enjoyable while supporting Montessori-inspired learning principles.

💡 Ideal for preschool and early primary school children.

Maisha Muneeba designed the game idea and learning concepts.

🎮 Try it here:
https://mdabashar.github.io/Simple-Games/montessori-math-v3-improved-fixed.html

She would love to hear your feedback and suggestions for future improvements!

